# The Flagged view lists flagged tasks, notes and projects, values included, and hides done ones once completed blocks are hidden.
file <<END
Old: @done(2026-01-01)
	- Inside old @flag
New:
	- Open one @flag(urgent)
	- Closed one @flag @done(2026-01-02)
	Plain note @flag
	Sub: @flag
END
keys gF
see - Inside old 󰈻  Old
see - Open one 󰈻  New
see ✔ Closed one 󰈻  New
see Plain note 󰈻  New
see Sub: 󰈻  New
keys gc
hide Inside old
hide Closed one
see - Open one
quit
